# ============================================
# ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ============================================
#
# This project uses a consolidated .env file in the root directory.
#
# To configure your environment:
# 1. Copy /path/to/project/.env.example to /path/to/project/.env
# 2. Update the values in .env with your configuration
#
# The root .env file contains all environment variables for both
# the Strapi CMS and the Next.js web application.
#
